low clearing snow along a road next to a snowbank the same height as the snowplow\"","line":11,"embedded":true},{"title":"black and white photo of snow drift covering 2/3 of a tall window and glass doors outside a brick building viewed from inside","target":"https://www.nps.gov/npgallery/GetAsset/3745672d-1edd-4d63-978b-58da3f7ed7b1/proxy/hires? \"black and white photo of snow drift covering 2/3 of a tall window and glass doors outside a brick building viewed from inside\"","line":11,"embedded":true},{"title":"black and white photo of a grizzly bear in front of a pine tree standing on some rocks with its mouth open","target":"https://www.nps.gov/npgallery/GetAsset/3772377e-ba47-4152-8410-a91e01386337/proxy/hires? \"black and white photo of a grizzly bear in front of a pine tree standing on some rocks with its mouth open\"","line":11,"embedded":true},{"title":"four men crouching under a cave wall, one man is wearing a park ranger uniform and holding a large, rolled up piece of paper","target":"https://www.nps.gov/npgallery/GetAsset/4b863c35-c1cf-45a9-9fb5-d04310616fe3/proxy/hires? \"four men crouching under a cave wall, one man is wearing a park ranger uniform and holding a large, rolled up piece of paper\"","line":11,"embedded":true},{"title":"colorized photo of a brick building with a large green lawn in front of it","target":"https://www.nps.gov/npgallery/GetAsset/535ec61a-f26d-49f6-92f8-c56db2789364/proxy/hires? \"colorized photo of a brick building with a large green lawn in front of it\"","line":11,"embedded":true},{"title":"a group of several horse and mule-drawn covered wagons traveling along a dirt road","target":"https://www.nps.gov/npgallery/GetAsset/5882354e-e281-492b-b656-b2dbb1f6c46c/proxy/hires? \"a group of several horse and mule-drawn covered wagons traveling along a dirt road\"","line":11,"embedded":true},{"title":"an older man standing in front of a film camera on a tripod in a cinder flat talking to the camera man","target":"https://www.nps.gov/np